# DoD CapFaces pad free-look / walk proof (Dolphin-first)
# Format: frames buttons stickX stickY cstickX cstickY
# Stick +Y = forward in PADStatus; C-stick X/Y = look.

# Settle after listen sign-on before driving axes.
8 - 0 0 0 0
# Walk forward
48 - 0 96 0 0
# Look right while walking
32 - 0 64 80 0
# Look left + slight pitch down
32 - 0 48 -80 24
# Strafe right
24 - 80 0 0 0
# Hold still so stills can catch the new eye
16 - 0 0 0 0
